sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant F as Next.js Frontend
    participant A as API Route
    participant AU as Supabase Auth
    participant DB as Supabase Postgres

    C->>F: Submit login credentials
    F->>A: POST /auth/callback (OAuth or credentials)
    A->>AU: Sign in with Supabase Auth
    AU-->>A: Session token
    A-->>F: Cookies / session
    F-->>C: Redirect to dashboard
    C->>F: Request cart or orders
    F->>A: GET /api/orders
    A->>DB: Query orders for user
    DB-->>A: Order rows
    A-->>F: JSON response
    F-->>C: Render UI